{
  "conversations": [
    {
      "conversationId": "mo&krill_yamato_convo01",
      "lines": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "character": "Yamato",
          "audioFile": "yamato_match_start_yamato_krill_convo01_01",
          "audioUrl": "audio/yamato_match_start_yamato_krill_convo01_01.mp3",
          "text": "You will work for me.",
          "duration": 1.696
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "character": "Mo&krill",
          "audioFile": "krill_match_start_yamato_krill_convo01_02",
          "audioUrl": "audio/krill_match_start_yamato_krill_convo01_02.mp3",
          "text": "Our alliance is temporary, I'm afraid\u2026Maurice and I value our independence.",
          "duration": 4.89
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "character": "Yamato",
          "audioFile": "yamato_match_start_yamato_krill_convo01_03",
          "audioUrl": "audio/yamato_match_start_yamato_krill_convo01_03.mp3",
          "text": "That wasn't a question.",
          "duration": 1.652
        },
        {
          "order": 4,
          "character": "Mo&krill",
          "audioFile": "krill_match_start_yamato_krill_convo01_04",
          "audioUrl": "audio/krill_match_start_yamato_krill_convo01_04.mp3",
          "text": "Your bargaining posture leaves something to be desired.",
          "duration": 2.991
        },
        {
          "order": 5,
          "character": "Yamato",
          "audioFile": "yamato_match_start_yamato_krill_convo01_05",
          "audioUrl": "audio/yamato_match_start_yamato_krill_convo01_05.mp3",
          "text": "I'm not bargaining.  I'm threatening.",
          "duration": 3.116
        },
        {
          "order": 6,
          "character": "Mo&krill",
          "audioFile": "krill_match_start_yamato_krill_convo01_06",
          "audioUrl": "audio/krill_match_start_yamato_krill_convo01_06.mp3",
          "text": "How charming.",
          "duration": 1.56
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "conversationId": "grey talon_lash_convo01",
      "lines": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "character": "Lash",
          "audioFile": "lash_match_start_lash_orion_convo01_01",
          "audioUrl": "audio/lash_match_start_lash_orion_convo01_01.mp3",
          "text": "How you feeling old man?",
          "duration": 1.712
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "character": "Grey talon",
          "audioFile": "orion_match_start_lash_orion_convo01_02",
          "audioUrl": "audio/orion_match_start_lash_orion_convo01_02.mp3",
          "text": "I was feeling better before you started talking.",
          "duration": 2.709
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "character": "Lash",
          "audioFile": "lash_match_start_lash_orion_convo01_03",
          "audioUrl": "audio/lash_match_start_lash_orion_convo01_03.mp3",
          "text": "I get it.  It must be harder seeing a younger you tear shit up.",
          "duration": 5.477
        },
        {
          "order": 4,
          "character": "Grey talon",
          "audioFile": "orion_match_start_lash_orion_convo01_04",
          "audioUrl": "audio/orion_match_start_lash_orion_convo01_04.mp3",
          "text": "Your delusions of grandeur are impressive",
          "duration": 2.649
        },
        {
          "order": 5,
          "character": "Lash",
          "audioFile": "lash_match_start_lash_orion_convo01_05",
          "audioUrl": "audio/lash_match_start_lash_orion_convo01_05.mp3",
          "text": "Goddamn right they are.",
          "duration": 2.01
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "conversationId": "grey talon_lash_convo02",
      "lines": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "character": "Lash",
          "audioFile": "lash_match_start_lash_orion_convo02_01",
          "audioUrl": "audio/lash_match_start_lash_orion_convo02_01.mp3",
          "text": "You think I got what it takes to be in the Baxter Society",
          "duration": 3.274
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "character": "Grey talon",
          "audioFile": "orion_match_start_lash_orion_convo02_02",
          "audioUrl": "audio/orion_match_start_lash_orion_convo02_02.mp3",
          "text": "I do.  You're prowess is undeniable.",
          "duration": 3.758
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "character": "Lash",
          "audioFile": "lash_match_start_lash_orion_convo02_03",
          "audioUrl": "audio/lash_match_start_lash_orion_convo02_03.mp3",
          "text": "Boush.",
          "duration": 0.983
        },
        {
          "order": 4,
          "character": "Grey talon",
          "audioFile": "orion_match_start_lash_orion_convo02_04",
          "audioUrl": "audio/orion_match_start_lash_orion_convo02_04.mp3",
          "text": "You'd begin your career with a string of modest successes, each one throwing logs on the fire of self confidence.",
          "duration": 7.312
        },
        {
          "order": 5,
          "character": "Lash",
          "audioFile": "lash_match_start_lash_orion_convo02_05",
          "audioUrl": "audio/lash_match_start_lash_orion_convo02_05.mp3",
          "text": "Obviously.",
          "duration": 1.137
        },
        {
          "order": 6,
          "character": "Grey talon",
          "audioFile": "orion_match_start_lash_orion_convo02_06",
          "audioUrl": "audio/orion_match_start_lash_orion_convo02_06.mp3",
          "text": "Then you'd start taking more dangerous work.  Work that you feel only you could handle. Your unorthodox tactics work 100% of the time.  Until they don't.  And then your brothers find your skinless corpse in a retention pond in Portugual or Denmark.   It's always Portugal or Denmark.",
          "duration": 21.014
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}